# voxely-text-insertion

Canonical insert is UTF-16 `KEYEVENTF_UNICODE` into the captured window. Do not paste via clipboard restore races.

Insertion modes are only `unicode` and `clipboard`. `clipboard` copies and tells the user to paste; it must not send Ctrl+V.

Do not revive `auto` or `sendinput` aliases. Insertion errors must surface; transcript stays in history.
